{
  "id": "one-column-blue-rule",
  "name": "blue_rule_one_column",
  "description": "One column in the operator's reference style: a steel-blue name over a lighter title, contact icons, title-case headings over a full-width blue rule, and each entry as a bold role and italic employer with its dates and location right-aligned opposite. Skills and certificates print as two-column bullet lists. Sections run summary, education, skills, professional experience.",
  "disabled": false,
  "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>{{name}} - Resume</title>\n<style>\n@page{margin:0.5in 0.55in}\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{background:#ffffff}\nbody{font-family:'Segoe UI',Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.4;color:#1f2937}\n.header{margin-bottom:13px}\n.name{font-size:20pt;font-weight:700;color:#2e5f8b;line-height:1.15}\n.headline{font-size:13pt;font-weight:400;color:#4a6f93;margin-top:1px}\n.contact{font-size:9.5pt;color:#374151;margin-top:7px}\n.contact span{margin-right:15px;white-space:nowrap}\n.section{margin-bottom:11px}\n/* Title case, as in the reference. The section marks a resume parser looks for\n   are case-insensitive, so \"Education\" reads the same to it as \"EDUCATION\". */\n.section-title{font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;color:#2e5f8b;padding-bottom:2px;\n  border-bottom:1.5px solid #3f6f9c;margin-bottom:6px}\n.summary-text{text-align:left}\n/* The two-column halves of an entry. The right one is a sibling of the left,\n   never a float: the separator pass measures the pair and inserts the space the\n   layout gap is not. */\n.entry{margin-bottom:9px}\n.entry:last-child{margin-bottom:0}\n.entry-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px}\n.entry-left{min-width:0}\n.entry-right{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9.5pt;color:#374151}\n.job-title,.edu-degree{font-weight:700}\n.company-name,.edu-institution{font-style:italic}\nul.achievements{margin:3px 0 0 15px}\nul.achievements li{margin-bottom:1px}\n/* Two columns, as in the reference. Down the first and then the second, which\n   is both what the picture shows and the order the text stream comes out in. */\nul.two-col{margin:0 0 0 15px;column-count:2;column-gap:22px}\nul.two-col li{margin-bottom:2px;break-inside:avoid}\n/* One group per bullet, so both halves stay on the line whichever of the six\n   render-time looks is drawn over them - those are written for a block per\n   group, and a block inside this list would break the bullet across two lines.\n   Pinned here, after nothing, because this stylesheet is the template's own and\n   the render-time one is written before it. */\n/* NO SECOND MARKER. The six render-time looks are written for a block per\n   group; one of them (\"marker\") puts a small square before the heading. In this\n   template each group is a LIST ITEM, so the list already draws a marker and the\n   square printed beside it - \"- * AI & LLM ENGINEERING:\" - which is what the\n   operator saw. The colon below is this template's own and already beats the\n   \"inline\" look's middle dot, because the template's stylesheet is written after\n   the render-time one. */\n.skill-category-title::before{content:none}\n.skill-category-title,.skill-category-skills{display:inline;color:#1f2937;margin:0;padding:0}\n.skill-category-title{font-weight:700}\n.skill-category-title::after{content:\":\"}\n.skill-category-skills{font-weight:400}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"header\">\n<div class=\"name\">{{name}}</div>\n<div class=\"headline\">{{title}}</div>\n<div class=\"contact\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:3px\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"/></svg>{{contact.email}}</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:3px\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13.1 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.64 4.55 2 2 0 0 1 3.62 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6.09 6.09l.97-.97a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg>{{contact.phone}}</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:3px\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg>{{contact.location}}</span>{{#if contact.linkedin}}<span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:3px\"><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/></svg>{{contact.linkedin}}</span>{{/if}}{{#if contact.github}}<span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:3px\"><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/></svg>{{contact.github}}</span>{{/if}}{{#if contact.portfolio}}<span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:3px\"><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"/></svg>{{contact.portfolio}}</span>{{/if}}</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Summary</div>\n<div class=\"summary-text\">{{summary}}</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Education</div>\n{{#each education}}\n<div class=\"entry edu-item\">\n<div class=\"entry-head\">\n<div class=\"entry-left\"><span class=\"edu-degree\">{{degree}}</span>{{#if institution}}, <span class=\"edu-institution\">{{institution}}</span>{{/if}}</div>\n<div class=\"entry-right\"><div class=\"job-date\">{{startDate}}{{#if endDate}} - {{endDate}}{{/if}}</div>{{#if location}}<div class=\"entry-location\">{{location}}</div>{{/if}}{{#if gpa}}<div class=\"entry-location\">GPA: {{gpa}}</div>{{/if}}</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n{{/each}}\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Skills</div>\n<ul class=\"two-col\">{{#if skillCategories.[0].category}}{{#each skillCategories}}<li><span class=\"skill-category-title\">{{category}}</span> <span class=\"skill-category-skills\">{{join skills \", \"}}</span></li>{{/each}}{{else}}{{#if hardSkills.length}}{{#each hardSkills}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}{{else}}{{#each skills}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}{{/if}}{{/if}}</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Professional Experience</div>\n{{#each experience}}\n<div class=\"entry\"><div style=\"break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid\">\n<div class=\"entry-head\">\n<div class=\"entry-left\"><span class=\"job-title\">{{title}}</span>{{#if company}}, <span class=\"company-name\">{{company}}</span>{{/if}}</div>\n<div class=\"entry-right\"><div class=\"job-date\">{{startDate}} - {{endDate}}</div>{{#if location}}<div class=\"entry-location\">{{location}}</div>{{/if}}</div>\n</div>\n</div><ul class=\"achievements\">{{#each achievements}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>\n</div>\n{{/each}}\n</div>\n\n{{#if certifications.length}}\n<div class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"section-title\">Certificates</div>\n<ul class=\"two-col\">{{#each certifications}}<li>{{name}}{{#if issuer}}, {{issuer}}{{/if}}{{#if date}} ({{date}}){{/if}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>\n</div>\n{{/if}}\n</body>\n</html>",
  "cssContent": "",
  "sections": [
    "summary",
    "education",
    "hardSkills",
    "experience",
    "certifications"
  ],
